      "body": "## Summary\n\nFollowing #44242 and #44270, add the `admin_api_key` check to 4 more state-mutating endpoints:\n\n- `/flush_cache` — clears the radix KV cache\n- `/load_lora_adapter` — loads a LoRA adapter without server restart\n- `/load_lora_adapter_from_tensors` — loads LoRA from tensors\n- `/unload_lora_adapter` — unloads a LoRA adapter\n\nWhen the server is started without `--admin-api-key`, these return 400 instead of allowing access with just `--api-key`.\n\nSigned-off-by: bantianyue <bantianyue@gmail.com>\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38572992963](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38572992963)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38572992850](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38572992850)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38572992691](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38572992691)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
